# Staging for native resources packaged by electron-builder (resources/vendor/).
#
# voice-helper.exe lands here via scripts/stage-voice-helper.mjs (run by
# `npm run build`) when the binary exists in voice-helper/build/Release/.
# The exe is NOT committed — see .gitignore. This directory is versioned
# because electron-builder needs the extraResources `from` to exist.
